Enable terminal and task smoke tests for reh-web builds

Upstream skips terminal and task tests on Linux due to pty host crashes
in Electron CI (issues #216564, #225250). In our reh-web build the pty
host runs as part of the server process and is stable. Gate the skip on
VSCODE_REMOTE_SERVER_PATH being unset so tests run in our environment.

Index: code-editor-src/test/smoke/src/areas/terminal/terminal.test.ts
===================================================================
--- code-editor-src.orig/test/smoke/src/areas/terminal/terminal.test.ts
+++ code-editor-src/test/smoke/src/areas/terminal/terminal.test.ts
@@ -37,17 +37,18 @@
 		});
 
 		// https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/216564
-		// The pty host can crash on Linux in smoke tests for an unknown reason. We need more user
-		// reports to investigate
-		setupTerminalEditorsTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
-		setupTerminalInputTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
-		setupTerminalPersistenceTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
-		setupTerminalProfileTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
-		setupTerminalTabsTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
-		setupTerminalShellIntegrationTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' });
+		// The pty host can crash on Linux in Electron smoke tests. In reh-web builds
+		// (VSCODE_REMOTE_SERVER_PATH set), the pty host is stable — enable tests.
+		const skipOnLinux = process.platform === 'linux' && !process.env.VSCODE_REMOTE_SERVER_PATH;
+		setupTerminalEditorsTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
+		setupTerminalInputTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
+		setupTerminalPersistenceTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
+		setupTerminalProfileTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
+		setupTerminalTabsTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
+		setupTerminalShellIntegrationTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux });
 		setupTerminalStickyScrollTests({ skipSuite: true });
 		// https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/pull/141974
 		// Windows is skipped here as well as it was never enabled from the start
-		setupTerminalSplitCwdTests({ skipSuite: process.platform === 'linux' || process.platform === 'win32' });
+		setupTerminalSplitCwdTests({ skipSuite: skipOnLinux || process.platform === 'win32' });
 	});
 }
